1
00:00:00,675 --> 00:00:02,555
(Sheldon:)Well, to celebrate
this reconciliation,

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:04,280
(Sheldon:)let's all share a milk shake.

3
00:00:04,445 --> 00:00:06,985
(Sheldon:)Penny, you'll need a straw.

4
00:00:13,388 --> 00:00:14,888
(Jesse:)-You're back.
-Yes, I am!

5
00:00:15,056 --> 00:00:16,536
(Bernadette:)There's a few more things
I want to say to you.

6
00:00:16,691 --> 00:00:19,691
(Bernadette:)Stuart's store is just fine, and he's
a much nicer person than you are,

7
00:00:19,861 --> 00:00:22,471
and it you still have that comic,
I'd like to buy it right now!

8
00:00:23,865 --> 00:00:25,035
(Jesse:)No problem.

9
00:00:25,199 --> 00:00:27,579
(Jesse:)Oh, you want a latte
while you wait?

10
00:00:27,735 --> 00:00:29,575
No, I don't want a latte!

11
00:00:29,737 --> 00:00:32,517
(Bernadette:)I want a cappuccino
and a blueberry scene!

12
00:00:33,241 --> 00:00:37,021
(Jesse:)-I only have chocolate chip.
-Well, that sounds even better!

13
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:46,201
(Bert:)Thanks for coming to the
mineral and rock show with me.

14
00:00:50,224 --> 00:00:52,764
(Raj:)We're sorry Amy didn't want to go.

15
00:00:52,927 --> 00:00:55,737
(Howard:)Really, really sorry.

16
00:00:56,898 --> 00:00:59,738
Nah, who needs her
when I have you guys?

17
00:00:59,901 --> 00:01:03,441
(Bert:)Rock show!
Rock show! Rock show!

18
00:01:03,905 --> 00:01:05,745
(Bert:)Rock show! Rock show!

19
00:01:05,907 --> 00:01:10,587
(Bert:)Rock show!
Rock show!

